            '| 3 | `[2,6]` | `[1,6]` | 2 ≤ 3 → merge, end grows to 6 |',
            '| 4 | `[8,10]` | `[1,6]` `[8,10]` | 8 > 6 → disjoint, new interval |',
            '| 5 | `[15,18]` | `[1,6]` `[8,10]` `[15,18]` | 15 > 10 → disjoint, new interval |',
