            '4. **Identical intervals** — the second one is absorbed, output has one copy.',
            '5. **Negative values** — sorting and merging work unchanged.',
            '',
            '## Common Mistakes',
            '',
            '- **Forgetting the sort** — the sweep only works on sorted input; merging an unsorted list gives wrong, order-dependent answers.',
            '- **Using `>=` vs `>` wrongly** — flips the touching-interval behaviour.',
            '- **Reading `res.back()[1]` on an empty list** — guard the empty case first.',
            '- **Only comparing, not extending** — the end must become `max`, otherwise contained intervals corrupt the result.',
            '- **Mutating the input while iterating it** — build the output list instead.',
            '',
            '## Applications',
            '',
