            '| Time | **O(n log R)** | Each feasibility check is O(n); the range shrinks in O(log R) steps |',
            '| Space | **O(1)** | Only a few variables beyond the input |',
            '| Range size | O(n) | `hi - lo` is at most the total sum minus the max element |',
