            '##5## Best so far and current run, both start at `a[0]`. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/java/java_variables.asp)',
            '##6## Start from the second element. [for]({java:for})',
            '##7## Restart at `a[i]` or extend the run. [Math]({java:Math})',
            '##8## Track the best run seen. [Math]({java:Math})',
