            '##6## Window sum and the best seen so far. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/java/java_variables.asp)',
            '##7## Seed the sum with the first window. [for]({java:for})',
            '##8## The first window is the initial best. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/java/java_variables.asp)',
            '##9## Slide the window across the rest. [for]({java:for})',
            '##10## Add the incoming element, drop the outgoing one. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/java/java_variables.asp)',
            '##11## Keep the best window. [Math]({java:Math})',
            '##13## Prints the maximum window sum. [println]({java:println})',
