            '##5## The first window is the initial best. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_variables.asp)',
            '##6## Slide the window across the rest. [range]({python:range})',
            '##7## Add the incoming element, drop the outgoing one. [Variables](https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_variables.asp)',
            '##8## Keep the best window. [if]({python:if})',
            '##10## Prints the maximum window sum. [print]({python:print})',
            '##12## Only runs when executed directly, not imported. [main]({python:main})',
            '##13## Calls `main()` so the program runs. [main]({python:main})',
