            '##5## The first window is the initial best. [var]({dart:var})',
            '##6## Slide the window across the rest. [for]({dart:for})',
            '##7## Add the incoming element, drop the outgoing one. [var]({dart:var})',
            '##8## Keep the best window. [var]({dart:var})',
            '##10## Prints the maximum window sum. [print]({dart:print})',
            '~~~',
            '',
            '~~~io',
            'input: a = [1, 4, 2, 10, 23, 3, 1, 0, 20], k = 4',
