            '',
            '## Binary Search',
            '',
            'Find a target in a sorted array by halving the search range each step — O(log n). Each iteration compares `a[mid]` and discards half of the remaining range.',
            '',
            '~~~explain',
            'lang: c',
            'group: binsearch',
            '#include <stdio.h>',
            'int main() {',
            '    int a[] = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9};',
            '    int n = 5, target = 7;',
            '    int lo = 0, hi = n - 1, idx = -1;',
            '    while (lo <= hi) {',
            '        int mid = (lo + hi) / 2;',
            '        if (a[mid] == target) {',
            '            idx = mid;',
            '            break;',
            '        } else if (a[mid] < target) {',
            '            lo = mid + 1;',
            '        } else {',
            '            hi = mid - 1;',
            '        }',
            '    }',
            '    if (idx >= 0) printf("found at index %d\\n", idx);',
            '    else printf("not found\\n");',
            '    return 0;',
            '}',
            '---',
            '##1## Includes the standard input/output header so `printf` is available. [stdio]({c:stdio})',
            '##2## Every C program starts executing in `main()`. [main]({c:main})',
            '##3## Sorted input. [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##4## Array length and the target value. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##5## Search range plus the found index. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##6## While the range is non-empty. [while]({c:while})',
            '##7## The middle index. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##8## Hit the target. [if]({c:if})',
            '##9## Remember the index. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##10## Done searching. [break](https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/language/break)',
            '##11## Target is in the right half. [if]({c:if})',
            '##12## Discard the left half. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##14## Target is in the left half. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##15## Discard the right half. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##17## Print the found index. [printf]({c:printf})',
            '##18## Print a miss. [printf]({c:printf})',
            '##19## Success exit. [return]({c:return})',
            '~~~',
            '',
