            '##10## One more merged interval. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##11## Overlaps → maybe extend. [if]({c:if})',
            '##12## Extend the running end if this one reaches further. [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##15## Prints the merged intervals. [for]({c:for})',
