            'tags: array, single-pass, min-so-far',
            'statement: Prices for `n` days; buy one day, sell on a later day. Return the maximum profit.',
            'approach: Track the minimum price seen so far; profit at day `i` is `prices[i] - minSoFar`. Maximize over all days. This is Kadane-flavored: the "lowest buy" is the running minimum.',
            'time: O(n)',
            'space: O(1)',
            'solution: buysellstock',
