            '##4## Vector with zeros to move. [vector]({cpp:vector})',
            '##5## Write pointer at index 0. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##6## Read pointer scans all elements. [For loops](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/for)',
            '##7## Copy non-zero values forward. [If statements](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/if)',
            '##9## Fill the tail with zeros. [fill](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/algorithm/fill)',
            '##10## Print the result. [for](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/range-for)',
            '##12## Success exit. [return](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/return)',
