            '~~~problem',
            'title: Majority Element',
            'difficulty: easy',
            'source: LeetCode 169 · Google, Microsoft',
            'tags: array, boyer-moore',
            'statement: Return the element that appears more than `n/2` times. It is guaranteed to exist.',
            'approach: Boyer–Moore voting. A candidate and a counter: increment on match, decrement otherwise; when the counter hits 0, take the current element as the new candidate. The majority survives.',
            'time: O(n)',
            'space: O(1)',
            'solution: majorityelement',
            '~~~',
            '',
            '~~~explain',
            'lang: c',
            'group: majorityelement',
            '#include <stdio.h>',
            'int main() {',
            '    int a[] = {3, 3, 4};',
            '    int n = 3;',
            '    int candidate = a[0], count = 1;',
            '    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {',
            '        if (a[i] == candidate) count++;',
            '        else if (--count == 0) {',
            '            candidate = a[i];',
            '            count = 1;',
            '        }',
            '    }',
            '    printf("%d\\n", candidate);',
            '    return 0;',
            '}',
            '---',
            '##1## Standard I/O header. [stdio]({c:stdio})',
            '##2## Entry point. [main]({c:main})',
            '##3## Input array. [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##4## Array length. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##5## First element is initial candidate. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##6## Scan from the second element. [For loops]({c:for})',
            '##7## Match: reinforce the candidate. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##8## Mismatch: cancel a vote. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##9## Counter hit zero — new candidate. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##10## Reset counter. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##13## Print the majority element. [printf]({c:printf})',
            '##14## Exit successfully. [return]({c:return})',
            '~~~',
            '',
            '~~~explain',
            'lang: cpp',
            'group: majorityelement',
