            '##2## Function returns max water area. [Functions](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Functions)',
            '##3## Two pointers and best area. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##4## Loop until pointers meet. [While loops](https://www.learn-c.org/en/While_loops)',
            '##5## Calculate area: min height times width. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##6## Update best area. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##7## Move shorter pointer inward. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##8## Move right pointer left. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##10## Return best area. [return]({c:return})',
            '##11## Entry point. [main]({c:main})',
            '##12## Height array. [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##14## Print result. [printf]({c:printf})',
            '##15## Exit successfully. [return]({c:return})',
