            'tags: array, dp, kadane-variant',
            'statement: Largest product of a contiguous subarray.',
            'approach: Track both max and min ending at each position, because a negative times a negative is positive. Swap them when `nums[i] < 0`. This is Kadane with two states.',
            'time: O(n)',
            'space: O(1)',
            'solution: maxprodsubarray',
