            '##12## Walk remaining intervals. [For loops]({c:for})',
            '##13## Overlap: merge by extending end. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##14## Update end if needed. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##15## No overlap: start a new interval. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##18## Print merged intervals. [For loops]({c:for})',
            '##20## Exit successfully. [return]({c:return})',
