            'tags: array, two-pointers, prefix-max',
            'statement: Given elevation map heights, compute how much water can be trapped.',
            'approach: Water at `i` = `min(leftMax[i], rightMax[i]) - h[i]`. Compute prefix and suffix maxima, or do it with two pointers keeping running maxima from both ends in O(1) space.',
