            '##2## Function returns max of each window. [Functions](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Functions)',
            '##3## Allocate result array. [malloc]({c:malloc})',
            '##4## Result size = n - k + 1. [Variables](https://www.learn-c.org/en/Variables)',
            '##5## Monotonic deque (index array). [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##6## Process each element. [For loops]({c:for})',
            '##7## Evict smaller values from back. [While loops](https://www.learn-c.org/en/While_loops)',
            '##8## Add current index to deque. [Arrays]({c:array})',
            '##9## Remove expired index from front. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##10## Record max once window is full. [If statements](https://www.learn-c.org/en/If_Statements)',
            '##12## Return result. [return]({c:return})',
            '##13## Entry point. [main]({c:main})',
            '##15## Print result. [For loops]({c:for})',
            '##17## Free memory. [free]({c:free})',
            '##18## Exit successfully. [return]({c:return})',
            '~~~',
