            '##7## Evict smaller values from back. [While loops](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/while)',
            '##8## Add current index. [push_back](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/vector/push_back)',
            '##9## Remove expired index. [pop_front](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/deque/pop_front)',
