            '##5## Result list. [List]({dart:List})',
            '##6## Process each element. [for]({dart:for})',
            '##7## Evict smaller from back. [while]({dart:while})',
            '##8## Add current index. [List]({dart:List})',
            '##9## Remove expired index. [if]({dart:if})',
            '##10## Record max. [List]({dart:List})',
            '##12## Print result. [print]({dart:print})',
            '~~~',
            '',
            '~~~io',
            'input: nums = [1, 3, -1, -3, 5, 3, 6, 7], k = 3',
            'output:',
